This project contains Linux kernel drivers, kernel patches and device trees.
They are licensed GPL-2.0-only, the same terms as the kernel they are built
into.

The full licence text is the one shipped with the Linux kernel as
COPYING / LICENSES/preferred/GPL-2.0, and is reproduced here by reference:

    https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/process/license-rules.html
    https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-2.0-only.html

Every driver source carries its own SPDX identifier. The scripts under
scripts/ and device/ are released under the same terms. Firmware in
firmware/ and the files in kernel/downstream-reference/ are NOT covered by
this licence; see THIRD-PARTY.md.
